  "type": "html",
  "props": {
    "content": "<style class=\"gs-who-css\">\n/* Persona cards: «Рацион под вашу цель». Four goal labels reused byte-verbatim from the\n   funnel's own plan cards (research/preview-v1418.html :757-819), so the cards scent-match\n   the configurator one screen up: «Похудей активно» 1 200, «Похудей легко» 1 500,\n   «Удержание формы» 1 800, «Набор массы» 2 500.\n   Price floors are the strings the funnel itself prints for the same four plans\n   (of-plan__price): от 5 000 / 5 500 / 6 000 / 6 500 ₸ за день. «от» is load-bearing: the\n   floor is the halved 14- and 30-day per-day rate from window.OLIVE_PRICING, so it is never\n   attached to a duration. Dish counts match the funnel meta lines (4 / 4 / 5 / 6 блюд) and\n   are spelled out, so the notes carry no digits at all.\n   No popularity badge on any card: the platform paints «Популярное» on 1 500 while the\n   orders data has 1 200 leading, so ours would either duplicate or contradict it.\n   Ground is soft to white to soft. It inserts a white breath between the funnel above and\n   the dish carousel below (both #F4F8EE today) and dissolves both seams; the cards carry\n   the structure.\n   Contrast, computed 2026-08-16 (WARM_ROUND §1): ink #20271A on white 15.37 AAA,\n   green #3F6B39 on white 6.22 AA, muted #4E5748 on white 7.55 AAA, deep #2C4E28 on white\n   9.43 AAA. Border #E3E8DE is the card-border hue already used by 70-plans and 40-dishes.\n   No gold and no lime in this block. Hover and focus are instant colour swaps; this band\n   carries no motion of any kind. */\n.gs-who{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--gs7-soft,#F4F8EE) 0,#fff 120px,#fff calc(100% - 120px),var(--gs7-soft,#F4F8EE) 100%)}\n.gs-who__grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px;margin-top:28px;text-align:left}\n.gs-who__card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #E3E8DE;\n  border-radius:18px;padding:16px 14px;min-height:150px;text-decoration:none;\n  box-shadow:var(--gs-sh-card,0 14px 30px -18px rgba(32,39,26,.22))}\n.gs-who__card:hover,.gs-who__card:focus-visible{border-color:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39)}\n.gs-who__goal{min-height:2.3em;font:800 1.0625rem/1.15 var(--gs-display,system-ui,sans-serif);\n  letter-spacing:-.02em;color:var(--gs7-ink,#20271A)}\n.gs-who__kcal{font:800 1.375rem/1 var(--gs-display,system-ui,sans-serif);\n  font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39)}\n.gs-who__kcal small{font:600 .75rem/1.2 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);color:var(--gs7-muted,#4E5748)}\n.gs-who__note{font:500 .8125rem/1.45 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);color:var(--gs7-muted,#4E5748)}\n.gs-who__price{font:700 .8125rem/1.35 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);color:var(--gs7-deep,#2C4E28)}\n.gs-who__go{margin-top:auto;font:700 .9375rem/1.3 var(--gs-text,sans-serif);color:var(--gs7-green,#3F6B39)}\n@media (min-width:900px){.gs-who__grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr)}.gs-who__goal{font-size:1.1875rem}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"gs-sec gs-who\" id=\"gsWho\">\n  <div class=\"gs-wrap gs-center\">\n    <h2 class=\"gs-h2\">Рацион под вашу цель</h2>\n    <p class=\"gs-lead\">Нет времени готовить, после зала или обед в офис. Выберите цель, меню соберём мы.</p>\n    <div class=\"gs-who__grid\">\n      <a class=\"gs-who__card\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"persona-1200\">\n        <span class=\"gs-who__goal\">Похудей активно</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__kcal\">1&nbsp;200 <small>ккал в день</small></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__note\">Самый лёгкий рацион. Четыре блюда в день.</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__price\">от&nbsp;5&nbsp;000&nbsp;₸ в&nbsp;день</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Выбрать →</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"gs-who__card\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"persona-1500\">\n        <span class=\"gs-who__goal\">Похудей легко</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__kcal\">1&nbsp;500 <small>ккал в день</small></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__note\">Мягкий режим на каждый день. Четыре блюда в день.</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__price\">от&nbsp;5&nbsp;500&nbsp;₸ в&nbsp;день</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Выбрать →</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"gs-who__card\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"persona-1800\">\n        <span class=\"gs-who__goal\">Удержание формы</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__kcal\">1&nbsp;800 <small>ккал в день</small></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__note\">После зала и в офис. Пять блюд в день.</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__price\">от&nbsp;6&nbsp;000&nbsp;₸ в&nbsp;день</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Выбрать →</span>\n      </a>\n      <a class=\"gs-who__card\" href=\"#orderFunnel\" data-cta=\"persona-2500\">\n        <span class=\"gs-who__goal\">Набор массы</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__kcal\">2&nbsp;500 <small>ккал в день</small></span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__note\">Самый плотный рацион. Шесть блюд в день.</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__price\">от&nbsp;6&nbsp;500&nbsp;₸ в&nbsp;день</span>\n        <span class=\"gs-who__go\" aria-hidden=\"true\">Выбрать →</span>\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
  }
}
